function effectWires(){return auxiliaryCards().map(e=>auxiliaryTargets(e).filter(id=>node(id)).map((id,index)=>{const type=auxiliaryType(e),label=`${type==='feedback'?'Feedback':'Effect'} ${e.title||effectInfo(e)?.title||e.kind} connected to ${node(id).title}`,origin=auxiliaryOutputPoint(e),sourceX=origin.x,sourceY=origin.y,target=auxiliarySocket(e,id);return `<g class="auxiliary-cable ${type}" data-auxiliary-wire="${escapeHTML(e.id)}" data-auxiliary-target="${escapeHTML(id)}" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="${escapeHTML(label)}; Delete disconnects" ><title>${escapeHTML(label)}. Drag either cable handle to reassign; right-click or Delete to disconnect.</title><path class="auxiliary-wire ${type}" d="${auxiliaryCable(e,id)}"></path><path class="wire-hit" d="${auxiliaryCable(e,id)}"></path>${[['card',sourceX+24+index*18,sourceY+(type==='feedback'?-14:5)],['scene',target.x-24-index*18,target.y+(type==='feedback'?14:-5)]].map(([endpoint,x,y])=>`<g class="auxiliary-handle" data-auxiliary-handle="${escapeHTML(e.id)}" data-auxiliary-target="${escapeHTML(id)}" data-auxiliary-endpoint="${endpoint}" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Reassign ${escapeHTML(label)} at ${endpoint==='card'?'auxiliary card':'scene'} end"><path class="auxiliary-wire ${type}" d="M ${endpoint==='card'?sourceX:target.x} ${endpoint==='card'?sourceY:target.y} L ${x} ${y}"/><circle class="auxiliary-handle-hit" cx="${x}" cy="${y}" r="10"/><circle class="auxiliary-end ${type}" cx="${x}" cy="${y}" r="4"/></g>`).join('')}</g>`;}).join('')).join('');}
function bindAuxiliaryWires(){$('connections').querySelectorAll('[data-auxiliary-wire]').forEach(el=>{el.onclick=event=>{event.stopPropagation();selection={type:'auxiliary-edge',id:el.dataset.auxiliaryWire,target:el.dataset.auxiliaryTarget};hideInspector();};el.oncontextmenu=event=>{if(reviewMode)return;event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();detachAuxiliary(el.dataset.auxiliaryWire,el.dataset.auxiliaryTarget);};el.onkeydown=event=>{if(reviewMode)return;if(['Delete','Backspace'].includes(event.key)){event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();detachAuxiliary(el.dataset.auxiliaryWire,el.dataset.auxiliaryTarget);}if(['Enter',' '].includes(event.key)){event.preventDefault();pendingAuxiliary=el.dataset.auxiliaryWire;$('connection-hint').hidden=false;$('connection-hint').textContent='Select another matching scene socket to add a connection.';}};});$('connections').querySelectorAll('[data-auxiliary-handle]').forEach(handle=>{handle.onpointerdown=event=>beginAuxiliaryRewire(event,handle.dataset.auxiliaryHandle,handle.dataset.auxiliaryTarget,handle.dataset.auxiliaryEndpoint);handle.onkeydown=event=>{if(['Enter',' '].includes(event.key)){event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();auxiliaryRewireDialog(handle.dataset.auxiliaryHandle,handle.dataset.auxiliaryTarget);}};});}
function auxiliaryRewireDialog(id,target){const source=auxiliaryCard(id);if(!source)return;openDialog(`<h2>Reassign ${auxiliaryType(source)}</h2><p>Choose a card to share with ${escapeHTML(node(target)?.title)}.</p>${auxiliaryCards().filter(card=>card.id!==id&&auxiliaryType(card)===auxiliaryType(source)).map(card=>`<button data-reassign-auxiliary="${escapeHTML(card.id)}">${escapeHTML(card.title||effectInfo(card)?.title||card.kind)} · ${escapeHTML(card.id)}</button>`).join('')}<button id="disconnect-auxiliary-link">Disconnect this scene</button>`);$('detail-content').querySelectorAll('[data-reassign-auxiliary]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{rewireAuxiliary(id,target,b.dataset.reassignAuxiliary,'card');$('detail').close();});$('disconnect-auxiliary-link').onclick=()=>{rewireAuxiliary(id,target,null,'disconnect');$('detail').close();};}

function beginAuxiliaryConnection(event,id){if(reviewMode)return;event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();if(pendingAuxiliaryScene)return;hideInspector();pendingAuxiliaryScene=null;pendingAuxiliary=id;drag={type:'auxiliary-connection',id,startX:event.clientX,startY:event.clientY,moved:false};$('viewport').setPointerCapture(event.pointerId);$('connection-hint').hidden=false;$('connection-hint').textContent='Drop on a scene card or matching socket to add a connection.';}
